* hand-written deck, not exported from any drawing
.title Small-signal model of a common-emitter stage with a current-controlled source (beta i_b)
.subckt SSCEBETA b c
.iodir b=input c=output
.name b v_in
.name c v_out
RPI b 0
.name RPI r_π
F1 c 0 RPI
.label F1 β i_b
RO c 0
.name RO r_o
RC c 0
.name RC R_C
.ends
